;
; How Trellis files one device of the owner's mesh in MYRA
; (trellis_rules.h TL4): its place in the roster (0..7, devmesh.h's
; DM_MAX_DEVICES), its state (TRELLIS_ACTIVE, TRELLIS_REVOKED), its role
; (trellis_model.h TRELLIS_ROLE_*), its admin and held flags, and the
; roster version it has held since. The rules say what the values may
; mean; this says whether they make a record.
^ZXTRELLIS(peer:i1) = state:i1! ^ role:i1! ^ admin:i1! ^ held:i1! ^ since:i18!
